  "changelog": "Universal Desktop-to-VR Visual Parity & Aspect Alignment v0.1.19",
  "features": [
    "Dynamic Desktop-to-VR Aspect Ratio Alignment: Completely eliminates vertical funhouse-mirror stretching (1.8x elongation) by automatically computing source-to-headset aspect scale and aligning 3D projection rays so geometry matches 1:1 desktop physical proportions",
    "Perceptual Filmic Color Harmonization: Protected shadow toe and soft highlight shoulder prevents blacks from crushing in dark scenes (Sekiro shrine, Mortal Shell crypts, Hogwarts interior) while maintaining vibrant midtones and desktop lighting richness",
    "Universal Disocclusion & Skybox Preservation: Horizon boundary detection and edge-aware inpainter prevent pitch-black voids in peripheral and distant scenery",
    "Universal Cross-Game Engine Parity: Fix automatically applies across all titles (DX11, DX12, Vulkan) without requiring manual per-game slider tweaking"
  ],
  "fixes": [
    "Eliminated vertical geometric elongation in 16:9 widescreen games injected into square VR headsets",
    "Fixed shadow crushing caused by linear contrast pivots on gamma-encoded textures"
  ],
